{'symbol': 'TGT', 'date': '2023-03-09 06:30:00', 'title': 'TARGET CORPORATION DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS , MARCH 9, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF TARGET CORPORATION (NYSE:TGT) HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.08 PER COMMON SHARE.\xa0 THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE JUNE 10, 2023 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS MAY 17, 2023.'}